  "details": "When I want to match a user's eye height, there have been a few times when I wanted to see the scale they were at before I actually click the match button.\n\nMy idea is to change the button from the eye icon to the user's height when you hover over the button. The eye icon would still be there to make it distinguishable, but it would still let you see the height of the selected user. \n\nI think this is a small QOL change, but I think it would be nice to see this implemented in the game.",
